13
00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:54.600
No locked features. No monthly bill.

14
00:00:54.900 --> 00:00:57.200
More control over your creative work.

15
00:00:57.600 --> 00:01:00.850
Try OpenCanvas today — follow the link on screen.

16
00:01:01.400 --> 00:01:05.900
OpenCanvas: your designs, your device, your choice.
